#: ../../user/templates/tauri.md:73
msgid ""
"Rust dependencies (`src-tauri/Cargo.toml`) pin `tauri = \"2\"`, `tauri-"
"build = \"2\"`, `serde`, and `serde_json` only — extend per command "
"surface as needed."
